    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i'm a bit worried about the audit part though. sometimes when im looking at my expenses it feels like things just aren't balancing out or money is disappearing from my spreadsheets and i can't find where it went. what kind of stuff should i look for to make sure my books are actually clean and nothing is 'sneaking' past me?",
