      "content": "To ensure your books are clean, prioritize reconciling your bank and credit card statements with QuickBooks entries weekly to catch unrecorded transactions immediately. You should also categorize every expense consistently and triple-check that all sales invoices are recorded to prevent revenue from disappearing into your spreadsheets. Finally, maintain a dedicated photo file or secure copy of every receipt matching a transaction in case any small items are left out of your spreadsheets.",
